ttps://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lEuLAubp74HYztEyNYpEx3AoqOu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iytQNneOp4lNSKktRh9T6Fo3UXk.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A portrait of Ennio Morricone, the most popular and prolific film composer of the 20th century, the one most loved by the international public, a two-time Oscar winner and the author of over five hundred unforgettable scores.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Music\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":611291,\"title\":\"Bring the Soul: The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7x5CguA0MxHqbSjhi14UEuK7c95.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nQRTynJcXF5GRcyEHF09yZIuQ7F.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A glimpse into K-pop group BTS’ world away from the stage, featuring intimate group discussions alongside spectacular concert performances from their world tour.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13576,\"title\":\"Michael Jackson's This Is It\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8GvQzHFSqr9KhyVxLEpB5dXPOWG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mqAuLsN6oOme6lSKoTb6yyP4U8E.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A compilation of interviews, rehearsals and backstage footage of Michael Jackson as he prepared for his series of sold-out shows in London.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":553512,\"title\":\"Burn the Stage: The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pJKy1yvnKh8UjcuYeG3Rt35xHFA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aQ7444JX7gefPhGJTlvilj3zG2S.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Burn the Stage: the Movie is the first movie from BTS, going behind-the-scenes of the BTS WINGS TOUR to reveal the full story of the band’s meteoric rise to fame. This unmissable film provides an intimate look at what happens when the most successful global boy band of all time breaks down barriers and invades the mainstream music scene. Exclusive tour footage and brand-new one-on-one interviews with BTS members give fans an unprecedented glimpse into their lives and an opportunity for everyone to celebrate together worldwide.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1445363,\"title\":\"EPiC: Elvis Presley in Concert\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2K2NH5dforjT9kLcUC0eeBpdZkC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ttOBvac1oW0OCCfFzZlXh3NeKyl.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Long-lost footage from Elvis Presley's legendary Las Vegas residency in the 1970s woven together with rare 16mm footage from Elvis on Tour, and 8mm from the Graceland archive, plus recordings of Elvis telling \\\"his side of the story\\\" rediscovered during Baz Luhrmann's research for his 2022 film, Elvis.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1637319,\"title\":\"Hannah Montana 20th Anniversary Special\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2BZ0bij5ORSvfDepCDD8CqVcpaG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w9NnNrq1aOu9hXhhUyMhQMts1oM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Filmed in front of a live studio audience and hosted by Alex Cooper of 'Call Her Daddy' fame, Miley Cyrus reflects on the creation and impact of the series with never-before-seen archival footage, all the while interacting and reminiscing on some of the show's most memorable sets 'brought back to life' — including the Stewart family living room and the legendary Hannah Montana closet.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":776527,\"title\":\"Summer of Soul (...Or, When the Revolution Could Not Be Televised)\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8kNwhqUGvpzWJd60O1Qvb8G6psK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1LYWnmr5K3Hs3XEZ323bY0dBZsK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During the same summer as Woodstock, over 300,000 people attended the Harlem Cultural Festival, celebrating African American music and culture, and promoting Black pride and unity. The footage from the festival sat in a basement, unseen for over 50 years, keeping this incredible event in America's history lost — until now.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Documentary\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1236419,\"title\":\"Piece by Piece\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fmOPcP8WRvm8cok4Hz3REwD7rlJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oqWTbBixgF8XwqzGeFWMzkNwqAw.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A unique cinematic experience that invites audiences on a vibrant journey through the life of cultural icon Pharrell Williams. Told through the lens of LEGO® animation, turn up the volume on your imagination and witness the evolution of one of music's most innovative minds.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Music\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":654754,\"title\":\"Billie Eilish: The World's a Little Blurry\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bDQ95W5LPHW9FHlPj3QX3jvM9Z7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8ys6VgwZCIQ7nN4Nv4z7GPPuFMv.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This documentary offers a deeply intimate look at extraordinary teenager Billie Eilish. Award-winning filmmaker R.J. Cutler follows her journey on the road, onstage, and at home with her family as the writing and recording of her debut album changes her life.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1041513,\"title\":\"Encanto at the Hollywood Bowl\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sa3Ku5yNVjp8NloWxJoI9dQjvOi.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xk8GTxGGDNMLDdho3XCNHJHYuDk.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Step into Casa Madrigal for a special concert spectacular as the original voice cast of Disney Animation's Oscar®-winning \\\"Encanto,\\\" Stephanie Beatriz, Adassa, Carolina Gaitán, Jessica Darrow, Diane Guerrero, Mauro Castillo, Angie Cepeda and Olga Merediz, along with special guests including Colombian superstar Carlos Vives, reunites for \\\"Encanto at the Hollywood Bowl.\\\" This unprecedented concert experience gives you a front-row seat to the musical extravaganza celebrating the global phenomenon.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":879805,\"title\":\"I Am: Celine Dion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v0zvMBdwzgSAj9xCufxDuq1WoJO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1iroQlJdPccnoUi4PGsIRFWPLBV.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A raw and honest behind-the-scenes look at the iconic superstar's struggle with a life-altering illness. Serving as a love letter to her fans, this inspirational documentary highlights the music that has guided her life while also showcasing the resilience of the human spirit.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"ROf1j4iovCk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"A5QHGj9y0mo\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"fU9EHiw8RXw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}